  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Gorgeous home in Old Seagrove! Owner managed so lots of personal touches!<br><br>Why settle for the ordinary?! Truly treat you and your family to an exceptional experience because you deserve it!<br>Gorgeous home with a beautiful 1bedroom/1 bath carriage home over two car garage near seaside and close to beach. Leave your worries (and beach gear) at home and experience paradise including a DUNE BUGGY, 6 seater GOLF CART, PRIVATE POOL, bikes/tricycles, beach chair set up for 4 daily with 2 umbrellas(March-oct), additional beach chairs to take to beach, beach towels, PlayStation,ping pong, foosball, basketball goal, bocce ball, croquet set, ARCADE games and more!<br><br>The Main Level<br>The brick, circular driveway sets the tone, and the curved staircase will lead you to the covered porch that enters to the main level of the home. This entrance leads you to the open floorplan and the heart of the home…here, you will find the wide open views of the kitchen, Family room and dining area. The main living portion of the home features 14’ high ceilings, hardwood flooring, rich moldings, elaborate doors and 3 primary bedrooms, each containing their en suite bathrooms…all featuring high end tiles, lights and counters.<br><br>The Family room has a fireplace as does the screened porch off the main level…speaking of the screened porch, you can relax in the glow of a fire in the fireplace while you watch tv, or listen to the fountains of the pool below.<br><br>Upper level<br>A large loft/sitting area with smart tv and overlooks the main family room/kitchen area below. The vaulted ceiling creates are dramatic flair to the upper level and also allows for a very comfortable conversation/gathering area. There’s also 2 bedrooms with their own full baths. The additional bunk space (which has 3 full beds) also has a full bath which covers the bunk area sleepers as well as guest visiting in the loft area.<br><br>Lower Level<br>As you go down to the lower level, you will be greeted by the island style bar that opens to the Theatre Room, which features an 85” upgraded tv with surround sound like no other!<br><br>There is a full bath and half bath on this level…a roll out bed is there for those who would like to use this area, but the couch is quite a comfortable space that may lure most to rest before setting up the bed!<br><br>Leave the doors open and listen to the water streaming into the pool, or enjoy the second, large, covered porch that has 2 glass garage doors which can be raised to bring all of the outdoor living together…and why not challenge others to a game of Foosball, Ping Pong or Croquet?!<br><br>Pool can be heated for charge of $50/day.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "5⭐️ home w/CARR HOUSE!PVT POOL!DUNE BUGGY!6 Seater GOLF CART!5 min walk 2 beach!"
        }
